{% endcomment %}# iCorrect - Apple Repair Specialists London
> Specialist MacBook, iPhone, iPad, and Apple Watch repair in Fitzrovia, Central London, with free UK-wide collection on orders £200+. Microelectronics logic board repair, liquid damage recovery, dead MacBook power-rail repair, and genuine Apple display panel-only replacement.

## Core MacBook Specialties

- MacBook liquid damage recovery (ultrasonic cleaning, component-level logic board restoration, data preservation)
- Dead and no-power MacBook repair (power-rail micro-soldering, USB-C / MagSafe controller repair, non-charging faults)
- MacBook screen repair (genuine Apple displays fitted panel-only into your original lid, calibrated in-house)
- MacBook battery, keyboard, trackpad, and charging port replacement
- iPhone, iPad, and Apple Watch repair
- Corporate repair accounts for London studios, agencies, and businesses

