## About iCorrect

iCorrect is an independent Apple microelectronics repair workshop in Fitzrovia, Central London. Every repair is carried out in-house by our board-level technicians, never outsourced.

**Address:** 12 Margaret Street, Audley House, Fitzrovia, London W1W 8JQ
**Hours:** Mon to Thu 9am to 6pm, Friday 10am to 6pm, Sat & Sun closed
**Phone:** +44 20 7099 8517
**Email:** support@icorrect.co.uk
**Reviews:** 4.8 from 750+ Google reviews
**Turnaround:** Standard 2 working days once your device reaches our workshop
**Warranty:** 2-year warranty included on repairs
**Collection:** Free UK-wide collection on orders £200+ (same-day London courier in selected zones, or free tracked and insured UK mail-in pack)
